#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_27_72859dcc
msgid ""
"Does the auditor include in that paragraph a clear reference to the matter "
"being emphasized and a cross-reference to the relevant note to the financial"
" statements where the matter is disclosed?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah auditor dalam paragraf tersebut menyertakan rujukan yang jelas kepada "
"hal yang ditekankan serta rujukan silang ke catatan relevan pada laporan "
"keuangan tempat hal tersebut diungkapkan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_28_4932278f
msgid ""
"Does the auditor refrain from modifying the opinion in relation to the "
"matter being emphasized?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah auditor tidak mengubah opini terkait hal yang ditekankan tersebut?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_1_1ad3053e
msgid ""
"Does the auditor’s report include the required registration number in "
"accordance with applicable laws and regulations?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah laporan auditor memuat nomor registrasi yang diwajibkan sesuai hukum "
"dan peraturan yang berlaku?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_2_3dd0601c
msgid ""
"Does the auditor’s report include the title \"Independent Auditor’s "
"Report\"?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah laporan auditor memuat judul \"Laporan Auditor Independen\"?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_17_502adf7b
msgid ""
"Does the auditor’s report state the location within the jurisdiction in "
"which the auditor practices?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah laporan auditor menyatakan lokasi dalam yurisdiksi tempat auditor berpraktik?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_10_2afb93fa
msgid ""
"Does the independent auditor’s report explain management’s responsibility "
"for the financial statements?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah laporan auditor independen menjelaskan tanggung jawab manajemen atas laporan keuangan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_11_7cc175fd
msgid ""
"Does the independent auditor’s report include a section titled \"Auditor’s "
"Responsibility\"?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah laporan auditor independen memuat bagian berjudul \"Tanggung Jawab Auditor\"?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_9_cb5fcf1d
msgid ""
"Does the independent auditor’s report include a section titled "
"\"Management’s Responsibility for the Financial Statements\"?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah laporan auditor independen memuat bagian berjudul \"Tanggung Jawab Manajemen atas Laporan Keuangan\"?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_14_33a19f33
msgid ""
"Does the independent auditor’s report include a section titled \"Opinion\"?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah laporan auditor independen memuat bagian berjudul \"Opini\"?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_13_400e5abf
msgid ""
"Does the independent auditor’s report state that the audit was conducted in "
"accordance with auditing standards established by the Indonesian Institute "
"of Certified Public Accountants (IAPI) and that the auditor is required to "
"comply with ethical requirements?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah laporan auditor independen menyatakan bahwa audit dilaksanakan sesuai standar audit yang ditetapkan oleh Ikatan Akuntan Publik Indonesia (IAPI) dan bahwa auditor wajib mematuhi ketentuan etika?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_12_200a7771
msgid ""
"Does the independent auditor’s report state that the auditor’s "
"responsibility is to express an opinion on the financial statements based on"
" the audit?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah laporan auditor independen menyatakan bahwa tanggung jawab auditor adalah menyatakan opini atas laporan keuangan berdasarkan audit?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_4_0f28588a
msgid ""
"Does the introductory paragraph of the independent auditor’s report identify"
" the entity whose financial statements were audited?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah paragraf pendahuluan laporan auditor independen mengidentifikasi entitas yang laporan keuangannya diaudit?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_7_2c979277
msgid ""
"Does the introductory paragraph of the independent auditor’s report refer to"
" the summary of significant accounting policies and other explanatory "
"information?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah paragraf pendahuluan laporan auditor independen merujuk pada ringkasan kebijakan akuntansi signifikan dan informasi penjelasan lainnya?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_6_5d744dfb
msgid ""
"Does the introductory paragraph of the independent auditor’s report specify "
"each statement comprising the financial statements?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah paragraf pendahuluan laporan auditor independen merinci setiap laporan yang membentuk laporan keuangan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_5_d8bc7788
msgid ""
"Does the introductory paragraph of the independent auditor’s report state "
"that the financial statements have been audited?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah paragraf pendahuluan laporan auditor independen menyatakan bahwa laporan keuangan telah diaudit?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_8_0f88af32
msgid ""
"Does the introductory paragraph of the independent auditor’s report state "
"the date or period covered by each statement in the financial statements?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah paragraf pendahuluan laporan auditor independen menyatakan tanggal atau periode yang dicakup oleh setiap laporan dalam laporan keuangan?"

