#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_29_198966d2
msgid ""
"Has the auditor communicated the expectation and the related wording in the "
"auditor’s report to those charged with governance if the auditor will "
"include an Emphasis of Matter paragraph or an Other Matter paragraph in the "
"report?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah auditor telah mengomunikasikan ekspektasi dan redaksi terkait dalam laporan auditor kepada pihak yang bertanggung jawab atas tata kelola jika auditor akan memasukkan paragraf Penekanan atas Suatu Hal atau paragraf Hal Lain dalam laporan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_23_8fbaaf72
msgid ""
"Has the auditor disclaimed an opinion if sufficient appropriate audit "
"evidence could not be obtained and the auditor concluded that the possible "
"effects of undetected misstatements could be material and pervasive?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah auditor menyatakan tidak memberikan opini (disclaimer) jika bukti audit yang cukup dan tepat tidak dapat diperoleh dan auditor menyimpulkan bahwa kemungkinan efek salah saji yang tidak terdeteksi dapat material dan pervasif?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_21_9cd5535d
msgid ""
"Has the auditor expressed a qualified opinion if sufficient appropriate "
"audit evidence could not be obtained, and the auditor concluded that the "
"possible effects of undetected misstatements could be material but not "
"pervasive?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah auditor menyatakan opini wajar dengan pengecualian jika bukti audit yang cukup dan tepat tidak dapat diperoleh dan auditor menyimpulkan bahwa kemungkinan efek salah saji yang tidak terdeteksi dapat material tetapi tidak pervasif?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_20_244f81f4
msgid ""
"Has the auditor expressed a qualified opinion if, after obtaining sufficient"
" appropriate audit evidence, the auditor concluded that the misstatements, "
"individually or in the aggregate, are material but not pervasive to the "
"financial statements?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah auditor menyatakan opini wajar dengan pengecualian jika, setelah memperoleh bukti audit yang cukup dan tepat, auditor menyimpulkan bahwa salah saji secara individual atau gabungan material tetapi tidak pervasif terhadap laporan keuangan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_22_5c71d6c2
msgid ""
"Has the auditor expressed an adverse opinion if, after obtaining sufficient "
"appropriate audit evidence, the auditor concluded that the misstatements, "
"individually or in the aggregate, are material and pervasive to the "
"financial statements?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah auditor menyatakan opini tidak wajar jika, setelah memperoleh bukti audit yang cukup dan tepat, auditor menyimpulkan bahwa salah saji secara individual atau gabungan material dan pervasif terhadap laporan keuangan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_25_c8a8a4b7
msgid ""
"Has the auditor included an Emphasis of Matter paragraph when there is a "
"matter that is important and fundamental to users’ understanding of the "
"financial statements?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah auditor memasukkan paragraf Penekanan atas Suatu Hal ketika ada hal yang penting dan fundamental bagi pemahaman pengguna atas laporan keuangan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_19_c6ef6e49
msgid ""
"Has the auditor modified the opinion if sufficient appropriate audit "
"evidence was not obtained to conclude that the financial statements as a "
"whole are free from material misstatement?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah auditor memodifikasi opini jika bukti audit yang cukup dan tepat tidak diperoleh untuk menyimpulkan bahwa laporan keuangan secara keseluruhan bebas dari salah saji material?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_18_2240d11e
msgid ""
"Has the auditor modified the opinion if, based on the audit evidence "
"obtained, the auditor concluded that the financial statements as a whole are"
" not free from material misstatement?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah auditor memodifikasi opini jika, berdasarkan bukti audit yang diperoleh, auditor menyimpulkan bahwa laporan keuangan secara keseluruhan tidak bebas dari salah saji material?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_26_3a0df592
msgid "Has the auditor placed that paragraph after the Opinion paragraph?"
msgstr "Apakah auditor menempatkan paragraf tersebut setelah paragraf Opini?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review
#: model:general_audit_ws_fc75636.item,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_review.general_audit_ws_fc75636_item_15_7eba1612
msgid "Has the independent auditor’s report been signed?"
msgstr "Apakah laporan auditor independen telah ditandatangani?"

